2code for Herdr

parts/files.js and parts/changes.js are derived from the `files` and
`changes` mods shipped with the Herdr app (https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app,
defaults/mods/), licensed under the Apache License 2.0 (LICENSE-Herdr.txt).
They were changed for 2code: restyled to 2code's flat panels, git colors and
status badges, selective commits with a description, and translated text.

Icons in icons/ are from Lucide (https://lucide.dev), ISC license
(icons/LICENSE-Lucide.txt), as shipped with Herdr's mods.

File icons in icons/files/ and the lookup in lib/fileIcons.js come from
material-icon-theme (MIT, icons/files/LICENSE-material-icon-theme.txt), by way
of github.com/LaiqianDS/herdr-mods; regenerate with scripts/build-file-icons.mjs.
